# Process 3, the body of portal.New: its steps in the order it calls them.
# By hand: dfd --box 300x150 --per-row 5 --number --number-prefix 3. docs/flow.3.dfd -o flow.3.svg

{6 Add the chat}
> portal configuration
[3.1. Check the sections and open the content directory of each docs section
 so that every input and toc path stays inside the documentation root
 (portal.openSections)]
    > content directory path
    < content directory handle
    <Documentation root>
>
[3.2. Load the Elements assets
 or refuse to start without them
 (portal.loadAssets)]
> portal configuration, sections, Elements assets
[3.3. Build the router
 that sends each request to a section's page: a spec section's viewer page or raw spec, or a docs section's document list, document page or raw file, with the document sidebar from the section's toc file when it names one; and the Elements assets, and with a chat its routes
 (portal.newRouter)]
> portal
{HTTP server}

# type: portal configuration = portal.Config
# type: sections = []*portal.section
# type: content directory handle = io/fs.FS
# type: Elements assets = io/fs.FS
# type: portal = net/http.Handler
